{"kartari karmavyatihare": [{"id": "karttari karmmavyatihAre", "headword": "कर्त्तरि कर्म्मव्यतिहारे", "headword_slp1": "karttari karmmavyatihAre", "fold": "kartari karmavyatihare", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In denoting the agent, when reciprocity of action is to be expressed, the affixes of the आत्मनेपद are employed.\n\nTerms: आत्मनेपद", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्त्तरि कर्म्मव्यतिहारे १.३.१४", "१.३.१४", "१.३.१४ कर्त्तरि कर्म्मव्यतिहारे"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karttari karmmavyatihAre १.३.१४", "१.३.१४", "१.३.१४ karttari karmmavyatihAre"]}], "kartfsTe casarire karmaRi": [{"id": "kartfsTe cASarIre karmaRi", "headword": "कर्तृस्थे चाशरीरे कर्मणि", "headword_slp1": "kartfsTe cASarIre karmaRi", "fold": "kartfsTe casarire karmaRi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "After the verb नी , when it governs an incorporeal object in the agent, as its object, the आत्मनेपद is used.\n\nTerms: आत्मनेपद", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्तृस्थे चाशरीरे कर्मणि १.३.३७", "१.३.३७", "१.३.३७ कर्तृस्थे चाशरीरे कर्मणि"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kartfsTe cASarIre karmaRi १.३.३७", "१.३.३७", "१.३.३७ kartfsTe cASarIre karmaRi"]}], "karake": [{"id": "kArake", "headword": "कारके", "headword_slp1": "kArake", "fold": "karake", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The phrase कारक (meaning 'in the special relation to a word expressing an action') is to be understood in the following aphorisms.\n\nTerms: एक-द्वि-वचन", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कारके १.४.२३", "१.४.२३", "१.४.२३ कारके"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kArake १.४.२३", "१.४.२३", "१.४.२३ kArake"]}], "karmaRa yamaBiprEti sa sampradanam": [{"id": "karmaRA yamaBiprEti sa sampradAnam", "headword": "कर्मणा यमभिप्रैति स सम्प्रदानम्", "headword_slp1": "karmaRA yamaBiprEti sa sampradAnam", "fold": "karmaRa yamaBiprEti sa sampradanam", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The person whom one wishes to connect with the object of giving, is called सम्प्रदान or receipient.\n\nTerms: कारक-अपादान", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्मणा यमभिप्रैति स सम्प्रदानम् १.४.३२", "१.४.३२", "१.४.३२ कर्मणा यमभिप्रैति स सम्प्रदानम्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karmaRA yamaBiprEti sa sampradAnam १.४.३२", "१.४.३२", "१.४.३२ karmaRA yamaBiprEti sa sampradAnam"]}], "karturipsitataman karma": [{"id": "karturIpsitatamaM karma", "headword": "कर्तुरीप्सिततमं कर्म", "headword_slp1": "karturIpsitatamaM karma", "fold": "karturipsitataman karma", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "That which is intended should be most effected by the act of the agent is called the object or कर्म।\n\nTerms: कारक-कर्म", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्तुरीप्सिततमं कर्म १.४.४९", "१.४.४९", "१.४.४९ कर्तुरीप्सिततमं कर्म"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karturIpsitatamaM karma १.४.४९", "१.४.४९", "१.४.४९ karturIpsitatamaM karma"]}], "karmapravacaniyaH": [{"id": "karmapravacanIyAH", "headword": "कर्मप्रवचनीयाः", "headword_slp1": "karmapravacanIyAH", "fold": "karmapravacaniyaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "From this point as far as aphorism १.४.९७ treated of, are to be understood as having the name of कर्म-प्रवचनीय।\n\nTerms: छन्दस्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्मप्रवचनीयाः १.४.८३", "१.४.८३", "१.४.८३ कर्मप्रवचनीयाः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karmapravacanIyAH १.४.८३", "१.४.८३", "१.४.८३ karmapravacanIyAH"]}], "kartfkaraRe kfta bahulam‌": [{"id": "kartfkaraRe kftA bahulam‌", "headword": "कर्तृकरणे कृता बहुलम्‌", "headword_slp1": "kartfkaraRe kftA bahulam‌", "fold": "kartfkaraRe kfta bahulam‌", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "A word ending with the Instrumental -3rd case-affix, when it denotes the agent or instrument -- २.३.१८, is compounded diversely with what ends with a कृत् affix and the resulting compound is तत्-पुरुष ।\n\nTerms: समास-तत्-पुरुष", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्तृकरणे कृता बहुलम्‌ २.१.३२", "२.१.३२", "२.१.३२ कर्तृकरणे कृता बहुलम्‌"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kartfkaraRe kftA bahulam‌ २.१.३२", "२.१.३२", "२.१.३२ kartfkaraRe kftA bahulam‌"]}], "karmaRi ca": [{"id": "karmmaRi ca", "headword": "कर्म्मणि च", "headword_slp1": "karmmaRi ca", "fold": "karmaRi ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "A word ending with a sixth case-affix is not compounded with another, when the force of the genitive is that of the accusative.\n\nTerms: समास-विभक्ति-6", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्म्मणि च २.२.१४", "२.२.१४", "२.२.१४ कर्म्मणि च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karmmaRi ca २.२.१४", "२.२.१४", "२.२.१४ karmmaRi ca"]}], "kartari ca": [{"id": "karttari ca", "headword": "कर्त्तरि च", "headword_slp1": "karttari ca", "fold": "kartari ca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "A word ending with a sixth case-affix is not compounded with a word ending with त्रिच् or अक affix when the force of these latter affixes is that of an agent.\n\nTerms: समास-विभक्ति-6", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्त्तरि च २.२.१६", "२.२.१६", "२.२.१६ कर्त्तरि च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karttari ca २.२.१६", "२.२.१६", "२.२.१६ karttari ca"]}], "karmaRi dvitiya": [{"id": "karmaRi dvitIyA", "headword": "कर्मणि द्वितीया", "headword_slp1": "karmaRi dvitIyA", "fold": "karmaRi dvitiya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "When the object is not denoted by the termination of the verb i.e. when the verb does not agree with it, the 2nd case-affix is attached to the word.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-2", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्मणि द्वितीया २.३.२", "२.३.२", "२.३.२ कर्मणि द्वितीया"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karmaRi dvitIyA २.३.२", "२.३.२", "२.३.२ karmaRi dvitIyA"]}], "karmapravacaniyayukte dvitiya": [{"id": "karmapravacanIyayukte dvitIyA", "headword": "कर्मप्रवचनीययुक्ते द्वितीया", "headword_slp1": "karmapravacanIyayukte dvitIyA", "fold": "karmapravacaniyayukte dvitiya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The 2nd case-affix is employed after a word which is joined with a कर्मप्रवचनीयाः १.४.८३.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-2", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्मप्रवचनीययुक्ते द्वितीया २.३.८", "२.३.८", "२.३.८ कर्मप्रवचनीययुक्ते द्वितीया"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karmapravacanIyayukte dvitIyA २.३.८", "२.३.८", "२.३.८ karmapravacanIyayukte dvitIyA"]}], "kartfkaraRayostftiya": [{"id": "kartfkaraRayostftIyA", "headword": "कर्तृकरणयोस्तृतीया", "headword_slp1": "kartfkaraRayostftIyA", "fold": "kartfkaraRayostftiya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "In denoting the agent -- स्वतन्त्रः कर्ता १.४.५४, or the instrument -- साधकतमं करणम् १.४.४२, the 3rd case is used.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-3", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्तृकरणयोस्तृतीया २.३.१८", "२.३.१८", "२.३.१८ कर्तृकरणयोस्तृतीया"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kartfkaraRayostftIyA २.३.१८", "२.३.१८", "२.३.१८ kartfkaraRayostftIyA"]}], "karaRe ca stokalpakfcCrakatipayasyasatvavacanasya": [{"id": "karaRe ca stokAlpakfcCrakatipayasyAsattvavacanasya", "headword": "करणे च स्तोकाल्पकृच्छ्रकतिपयस्यासत्त्ववचनस्य", "headword_slp1": "karaRe ca stokAlpakfcCrakatipayasyAsattvavacanasya", "fold": "karaRe ca stokalpakfcCrakatipayasyasatvavacanasya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "When expressing an instrument-कारक, optionally after the words स्तोक 'little', अल्प 'little', कृच्छ्र 'difficulty' and कतिपय 'some', the 5th case-affix is used, when they do not denote material objects.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-5", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["करणे च स्तोकाल्पकृच्छ्रकतिपयस्यासत्त्ववचनस्य २.३.३३", "२.३.३३", "२.३.३३ करणे च स्तोकाल्पकृच्छ्रकतिपयस्यासत्त्ववचनस्य"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karaRe ca stokAlpakfcCrakatipayasyAsattvavacanasya २.३.३३", "२.३.३३", "२.३.३३ karaRe ca stokAlpakfcCrakatipayasyAsattvavacanasya"]}], "kartfkarmaRoH kfti": [{"id": "kartfkarmaRoH kfti", "headword": "कर्तृकर्मणोः कृति", "headword_slp1": "kartfkarmaRoH kfti", "fold": "kartfkarmaRoH kfti", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The 6th-Case-affix is used after a word, in denoting the agent and the object, when used along with a word ending with a कृत्-affix --कृदतिङ् ३.१.९३.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-6", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्तृकर्मणोः कृति २.३.६५", "२.३.६५", "२.३.६५ कर्तृकर्मणोः कृति"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kartfkarmaRoH kfti २.३.६५", "२.३.६५", "२.३.६५ kartfkarmaRoH kfti"]}], "kartuH kyaN salopasca": [{"id": "kartuH kyaN salopaSca", "headword": "कर्तुः क्यङ् सलोपश्च", "headword_slp1": "kartuH kyaN salopaSca", "fold": "kartuH kyaN salopasca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix क्यङ् is optionally used in the sense of 'behaving' after a word ending in a case-affix denoting the object of comparison of the agent and there is लोप (elision) of the final स of the noun if it ends in a स।\n\nTerms: क्यङ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्तुः क्यङ् सलोपश्च ३.१.११", "३.१.११", "३.१.११ कर्तुः क्यङ् सलोपश्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kartuH kyaN salopaSca ३.१.११", "३.१.११", "३.१.११ kartuH kyaN salopaSca"]}], "karmaRaH romanTatapoByan varticaroH": [{"id": "karmaRaH romanTatapoByAM varticaroH", "headword": "कर्मणः रोमन्थतपोभ्यां वर्तिचरोः", "headword_slp1": "karmaRaH romanTatapoByAM varticaroH", "fold": "karmaRaH romanTatapoByan varticaroH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix क्यङ् is used after the words रोमन्य 'ruminating' and तपस 'austerity', when they are used as the objects of the action of repeating and performing respectively.\n\nTerms: क्यङ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्मणः रोमन्थतपोभ्यां वर्तिचरोः ३.१.१५", "३.१.१५", "३.१.१५ कर्मणः रोमन्थतपोभ्यां वर्तिचरोः"], "sy