: "The affix ट comes after the verb कृञ् 'to make' when the word कर्म is in composition with it and the sense of the word to be formed is that of wages.\n\nTerms: ट", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्मणि भृतौ ३.२.२२", "३.२.२२", "३.२.२२ कर्मणि भृतौ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["karmaRi BftO ३.२.२२", "३.२.२२", "३.२.२२ karmaRi BftO"]}], "kartari BuvaH KisRucKukaYO": [{"id": "kartari BuvaH KizRucKukaYO", "headword": "कर्तरि भुवः खिष्णुच्खुकञौ", "headword_slp1": "kartari BuvaH KizRucKukaYO", "fold": "kartari BuvaH KisRucKukaYO", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affixes खिष्णुच् and खकञ् , when the word to be formed denotes an agent comes after the verb भू 'to become', when it is in composition with the words formed by the affix च्वि though not actually ending in the affix च्वि।\n\nTerms: खिष्णुच् and खकञ्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्तरि भुवः खिष्णुच्खुकञौ ३.२.५७", "३.२.५७", "३.२.५७ कर्तरि भुवः खिष्णुच्खुकञौ"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kartari BuvaH KizRucKukaYO ३.२.५७", "३.२.५७", "३.२.५७ kartari BuvaH KizRucKukaYO"]}], "kartaryupamane": [{"id": "kartaryupamAne", "headword": "कर्तर्युपमाने", "headword_slp1": "kartaryupamAne", "fold": "kartaryupamane", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix णिनि comes after a verb when in composition with a word denoting an object of comparison, expressing the agent, the sense of the affix being 'doing something like that', that is to say, when the उपपद agent is the standard of comparison of the agent denoted by the word to which the sense of the affix refers.\n\nTerms: णिनि", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कर्तर्युपमाने ३.२.७९", "३.२.७९", "३.२.७९ कर्तर्युपमाने"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kartaryupamAne ३.२.७९", "३.२.७९", "३.२.७९ kartaryupamAne"]}], "karaRe yajaH": [{"id": "karaRe yajaH", "headword": "करणे यजः", "headword_slp1": "karaRe yajaH", "fold": "karaRe yajaH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-en